{"name":"数字输入框","description":"数字输入框是用于填写数值并按设定步长增减的表单控件 · 购买数量、库存和价格可在这里直接输入或点加减号调整。它只能限制格式和范围，库存是否足够等业务规则仍要在提交时校验。 先知道 输入框 Input","quote":"数量那里只能填数字，最好能直接按加减。","agentPrompt":"请把购物车数量做成可直接输入、也可按 1 加减的数字输入框，范围为 1–20 且只接受整数。前端显示范围错误，提交时仍以后端实时库存为准，并验证库存变化时会给出可重试提示。","html":"<div class=\"detail-body detail-entry-input-number\"><section class=\"detail-hero\" id=\"detail-hero\"><div class=\"dh-head\"><h1>数字输入框<span>Number Input</span></h1></div><div class=\"dh-quote\"><span class=\"dh-quote-label\">你可能会说</span><p class=\"dh-quote-text\">数量那里只能填数字，最好能直接按加减。</p></div><div class=\"dh-tagline\"><strong class=\"dh-summary-lead\">数字输入框是用于填写数值并按设定步长增减的表单控件</strong><span class=\"dh-summary-separator\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span>购买数量、库存和价格可在这里直接输入或点加减号调整。它只能限制格式和范围，库存是否足够等业务规则仍要在提交时校验。</span><div class=\"prerequisite-row\" aria-label=\"先知道\"><span class=\"prerequisite-label\">先知道</span><div class=\"prerequisite-links\"><a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/input?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"input\">输入框 <b>Input</b></a></div></div></div><div class=\"alias-row\" aria-label=\"也常被叫作\"><span>也常被叫作</span><em>InputNumber</em><em>数字步进器</em><em>Numeric Stepper</em></div><div class=\"dh-demo\"><div class=\"dh-demo-viewport\"><div class=\"dh-demo-inner\"><span class=\"num-demo\"><button class=\"num-btn\">−</button><input class=\"num-input\" value=\"3\"><button class=\"num-btn\">＋</button></span>\n        <span class=\"num-demo\"><button class=\"num-btn\">−</button><input class=\"num-input\" value=\"19.90\"><button class=\"num-btn\">＋</button><span class=\"num-unit\">元</span></span></div></div></div></section><div class=\"lesson-extras\"><section class=\"lesson-agent-prompt\" aria-labelledby=\"lesson-agent-title\"><h2 id=\"lesson-agent-title\">你可以这样告诉 AI Agent</h2><blockquote><span class=\"lesson-agent-quote\" aria-hidden=\"true\">“</span><p>请把购物车数量做成可直接输入、也可按 1 加减的数字输入框，范围为 1–20 且只接受整数。前端显示范围错误，提交时仍以后端实时库存为准，并验证库存变化时会给出可重试提示。</p></blockquote></section></div><section class=\"distinctions\"><div class=\"section-title\">容易混淆？这样区分</div><div class=\"distinction-grid\"><div class=\"distinction-card\"><div class=\"distinction-head\"><span>数字输入框<small>Number Input</small></span><b>≠</b><a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/steps?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"steps\">步骤条 <b>Steps</b></a></div><p>有些设计系统也把加减数字的控件叫 Stepper，因此单独说 Stepper 容易产生歧义。<a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/input-number?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"input-number\" aria-label=\"数字输入框 Number Input\">数字输入框 <b>Number Input</b></a> 用来增减一个数值；<a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/steps?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"steps\" aria-label=\"步骤条 Steps\">步骤条 <b>Steps</b></a> 用来展示流程包含几个阶段。</p></div></div></section><div class=\"usage-grid\"><div class=\"usage-box use\"><h3><span class=\"mark\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 12.5 4.2 4.2L19 7\"></path></svg></span>什么时候用</h3><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>购物车改数量</b>：点加减比敲键盘快</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row between\"><span style=\"color:var(--text)\">机械键盘</span><span style=\"flex:1\"></span><span class=\"mk-btn outline\">−</span><span class=\"mk-input\" style=\"min-width:40px;justify-content:center\">2</span><span class=\"mk-btn outline\">＋</span></div></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>设置库存、限购</b>：整数且有业务含义</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"width:34px;color:var(--text-3)\">库存</span><span class=\"mk-btn outline\">−</span><span class=\"mk-input\" style=\"min-width:40px;justify-content:center\">50</span><span class=\"mk-btn outline\">＋</span></div></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>有明确上下限</b>：超出范围自动拦下</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row \"><span class=\"mk-btn outline\">−</span><span class=\"mk-input\" style=\"min-width:40px;justify-content:center\">1</span><span class=\"mk-btn outline\">＋</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">最小 1、最大 99，超出会被拦下</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>价格、金额</b>：需要固定小数位</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"width:34px;color:var(--text-3)\">价格</span><span class=\"mk-input\" style=\"min-width:64px;justify-content:center\">19.90</span><span style=\"color:var(--text-3)\">元</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">自动保留两位小数</span></div></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"usage-box dont\"><h3><span class=\"mark\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7l10 10M17 7 7 17\"></path></svg></span>什么时候不用</h3><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>手机号、身份证号</b>属于数字字符串：使用 <a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/input?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"input\" aria-label=\"输入框 Input\">输入框 <b>Input</b></a></div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"width:34px;color:var(--text-3)\">手机</span><span class=\"mk-btn outline\">−</span><span class=\"mk-input\" style=\"min-width:40px;justify-content:center\">138****6688</span><span class=\"mk-btn outline\">＋</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">手机号又不能加减</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">只需<b>近似选择数值</b>：使用 <a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/slider?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"slider\" aria-label=\"滑块 Slider\">滑块 <b>Slider</b></a></div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"color:var(--text-3)\">预算</span><span class=\"mk-progress\" style=\"width:110px\"><i style=\"width:45%\"></i></span><span style=\"color:var(--text-2)\">≈ 450</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">需要选择<b>日期或年份</b>：使用 <a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/date-picker?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"date-picker\" aria-label=\"日期选择器 Date Picker\">日期选择器 <b>Date Picker</b></a></div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row \"><span class=\"mk-input\">2026-07-21 📅</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">日期有专门的选择器</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>数值范围很大</b>：支持直接键盘输入，不只依赖加减按钮</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row \"><span class=\"mk-btn outline\">−</span><span class=\"mk-input\" style=\"min-width:40px;justify-content:center\">12,800</span><span class=\"mk-btn outline\">＋</span></div></div></div></li></ul></div></div><section><div class=\"section-title\">组成结构 · Anatomy</div><div class=\"anat-wrap\"><div class=\"anat-stage\"><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"root\"><span class=\"num-demo\"><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"minus\"><button class=\"num-btn\">−</button></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"box\"><input class=\"num-input\" value=\"3\"></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"plus\"><button class=\"num-btn\">＋</button></span></span></span></div><div class=\"anat-parts\"><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"root\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">1</span><span class=\"pn\">数字输入控件</span><span class=\"pe\">InputNumber</span></button><span class=\"pd\">输入框和加减按钮组成一个控件，也常叫数字步进器（Numeric Stepper）</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"minus\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">2</span><span class=\"pn\">减少按钮</span><span class=\"pe\">Minus</span></button><span class=\"pd\">点一下减一个步长</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"box\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">3</span><span class=\"pn\">数值输入框</span><span class=\"pe\">Input</span></button><span class=\"pd\">也可以直接键盘输入</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"plus\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">4</span><span class=\"pn\">增加按钮</span><span class=\"pe\">Plus</span></button><span class=\"pd\">到上限后置灰</span></div></div></div></section><section><div class=\"section-title\">常见变体 · Variants</div><div class=\"variant-grid\"><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">默认<span>Default</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><span class=\"num-demo\"><button class=\"num-btn\">−</button><input class=\"num-input\" value=\"3\"><button class=\"num-btn\">＋</button></span></div><div class=\"variant-when\">数量、库存等常规纯数字输入</div></div><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">带单位<span>With Unit</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><span class=\"num-demo\"><button class=\"num-btn\">−</button><input class=\"num-input\" value=\"10\"><button class=\"num-btn\">＋</button><span class=\"num-unit\">件</span></span></div><div class=\"variant-when\">价格、件数等需要标清计量单位</div></div><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">小尺寸<span>Small</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><span class=\"num-demo sm\"><button class=\"num-btn\">−</button><input class=\"num-input\" value=\"1\"><button class=\"num-btn\">＋</button></span></div><div class=\"variant-when\">卡片、行内等空间紧张的地方</div></div><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">禁用<span>Disabled</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><span class=\"num-demo disabled\"><button class=\"num-btn\">−</button><input class=\"num-input\" value=\"0\" disabled><button class=\"num-btn\">＋</button></span></div><div class=\"variant-when\">这个数值当前不允许改动</div></div></div></section><section class=\"scenes\"><div class=\"section-title\">典型使用场景</div><div class=\"scene-list\"><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">购物车数量</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"max-width:400px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)\">\n          <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px\">\n            <img src=\"/vibe-hub/source/assets/photo-cat.png\" style=\"width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:8px;object-fit:cover\" alt=\"\">\n            <div style=\"flex:1;min-width:0\">\n              <div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:600\">无线机械键盘 · 茶轴</div>\n              <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);margin:2px 0\">87 键 / 蓝牙双模</div>\n              <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:var(--red);font-weight:600\">¥ 329.00</div>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"num-demo\"><button class=\"num-btn\">−</button><input class=\"num-input\" value=\"2\"><button class=\"num-btn\">＋</button></span>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;gap:6px;margin-top:10px;padding-top:10px;border-top:1px solid var(--border-light);font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">共 2 件，合计 <b style=\"color:var(--red)\">¥ 658.00</b></div>\n        </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">商品库存设置</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"max-width:360px;margin:0 auto\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:6px\">库存管理 · 无线机械键盘</div>\n          <div class=\"input-number-sc-row\" style=\"border-top:0\"><span>现货库存</span><span class=\"num-demo\"><button class=\"num-btn\">−</button><input class=\"num-input\" value=\"50\"><button class=\"num-btn\">＋</button></span><em>件</em></div>\n          <div class=\"input-number-sc-row\"><span>库存预警</span><span class=\"num-demo\"><button class=\"num-btn\">−</button><input class=\"num-input\" value=\"10\"><button class=\"num-btn\">＋</button></span><em>件</em></div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);margin-top:6px\">低于预警值时，会在工作台提醒你补货</div>\n        </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">限购份数</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"max-width:380px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)\">\n          <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:10px\">\n            <div style=\"flex:1\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:600\">手冲咖啡体验课</div><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">每人限购 5 份 · 7 月 26 日开课</div></div>\n            <span class=\"demo-tag red\">限时</span>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">购买份数</span>\n            <span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px\"><span class=\"num-demo\"><button class=\"num-btn\">−</button><input class=\"num-input\" value=\"3\"><button class=\"num-btn\">＋</button></span><button class=\"btn btn-primary\">立即报名</button></span>\n          </div>\n        </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">价格录入</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"max-width:360px;margin:0 auto\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:6px\">商品定价</div>\n          <div class=\"input-number-sc-row\" style=\"border-top:0\"><span>售价</span><span class=\"num-demo\"><button class=\"num-btn\">−</button><input class=\"num-input\" value=\"19.90\"><button class=\"num-btn\">＋</button></span><em>元</em></div>\n          <div class=\"input-number-sc-row\"><span>会员价</span><span class=\"num-demo\"><button class=\"num-btn\">−</button><input class=\"num-input\" value=\"16.90\"><button class=\"num-btn\">＋</button></span><em>元</em></div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);margin-top:6px\">自动保留两位小数，最低不低于 0.01 元</div>\n        </div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"oil-ui-pro-recommendation\" aria-label=\"工具与支持\"><a class=\"oil-ui-pro-banner\" href=\"https://ui.oiloil.org/pro/\" target=\"_blank\" aria-label=\"了解 oil-ui-pro 完整版：让 AI 做 UI 设计的 Agent Skill\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"/vibe-hub/source/assets/services/oil-ui-pro-banner-zh.webp\" alt=\"oil-ui-pro：把 AI 的 UI 设计能力，推到极限。完整版多了交互、布局、配图、动效和反复评审。了解完整版。\" width=\"1600\" height=\"560\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></section><section class=\"references-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">延伸阅读 · 权威出处</div><div class=\"reference-list\"><a class=\"reference-link\" href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Element/input/number\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span class=\"reference-title\">数字类型输入框</span><span class=\"reference-source\">MDN ↗</span></a></div></section></div>","sourceUrl":"https://vibe-hub.org/input-number","markdown":"# 数字输入框Number Input\n\n你可能会说\n数量那里只能填数字，最好能直接按加减。\n\n**数字输入框是用于填写数值并按设定步长增减的表单控件**·购买数量、库存和价格可在这里直接输入或点加减号调整。它只能限制格式和范围，库存是否足够等业务规则仍要在提交时校验。\n先知道\n[输入框 **Input**](/vibe-hub/input?lang=zh)\n\n也常被叫作InputNumber数字步进器Numeric Stepper\n\n## 你可以这样告诉 AI Agent\n\n> “\n> 请把购物车数量做成可直接输入、也可按 1 加减的数字输入框，范围为 1–20 且只接受整数。前端显示范围错误，提交时仍以后端实时库存为准，并验证库存变化时会给出可重试提示。\n\n容易混淆？这样区分\n\n数字输入框Number Input**≠**[步骤条 **Steps**](/vibe-hub/steps?lang=zh)\n\n有些设计系统也把加减数字的控件叫 Stepper，因此单独说 Stepper 容易产生歧义。[数字输入框 **Number Input**](/vibe-hub/input-number?lang=zh) 用来增减一个数值；[步骤条 **Steps**](/vibe-hub/steps?lang=zh) 用来展示流程包含几个阶段。\n\n### 什么时候用\n\n- **购物车改数量**：点加减比敲键盘快\n\n机械键盘−2＋\n- **设置库存、限购**：整数且有业务含义\n\n库存−50＋\n- **有明确上下限**：超出范围自动拦下\n\n−1＋\n最小 1、最大 99，超出会被拦下\n- **价格、金额**：需要固定小数位\n\n价格19.90元\n自动保留两位小数\n\n### 什么时候不用\n\n- **手机号、身份证号**属于数字字符串：使用 [输入框 **Input**](/vibe-hub/input?lang=zh)\n\n手机−138****6688＋\n手机号又不能加减\n- 只需**近似选择数值**：使用 [滑块 **Slider**](/vibe-hub/slider?lang=zh)\n\n预算≈ 450\n- 需要选择**日期或年份**：使用 [日期选择器 **Date Picker**](/vibe-hub/date-picker?lang=zh)\n\n2026-07-21 📅\n日期有专门的选择器\n- **数值范围很大**：支持直接键盘输入，不只依赖加减按钮\n\n−12,800＋\n\n组成结构 · Anatomy\n\n−＋\n\n1数字输入控件InputNumber输入框和加减按钮组成一个控件，也常叫数字步进器（Numeric Stepper）\n\n2减少按钮Minus点一下减一个步长\n\n3数值输入框Input也可以直接键盘输入\n\n4增加按钮Plus到上限后置灰\n\n常见变体 · Variants\n\n默认Default\n\n−＋\n\n数量、库存等常规纯数字输入\n\n带单位With Unit\n\n−＋件\n\n价格、件数等需要标清计量单位\n\n小尺寸Small\n\n−＋\n\n卡片、行内等空间紧张的地方\n\n禁用Disabled\n\n−＋\n\n这个数值当前不允许改动\n\n典型使用场景\n\n购物车数量\n\n无线机械键盘 · 茶轴\n\n              \n87 键 / 蓝牙双模\n\n              \n¥ 329.00\n\n            −＋\n\n          \n共 2 件，合计 **¥ 658.00**\n\n商品库存设置\n\n库存管理 · 无线机械键盘\n\n          \n现货库存−＋件\n\n          \n库存预警−＋件\n\n          \n低于预警值时，会在工作台提醒你补货\n\n限购份数\n\n手冲咖啡体验课\n\n每人限购 5 份 · 7 月 26 日开课\n\n            限时\n\n          \n购买份数\n            −＋立即报名\n\n价格录入\n\n商品定价\n\n          \n售价−＋元\n\n          \n会员价−＋元\n\n          \n自动保留两位小数，最低不低于 0.01 元\n\n延伸阅读 · 权威出处\n\n[数字类型输入框MDN ↗](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Element/input/number)"}